    {
      "text": "In the harbor kingdom of Tessaly, there lived a mapmaker named Orsa, whose charts were renowned for one peculiar habit. Wherever her knowledge ended, she left the paper empty and wrote a single word across it: \"Unknown.\"",
      "ja": "港の王国テッサリーに、オルサという地図師がいた。彼女の海図は、ある変わったくせで有名だった。自分の知識がつきるところでは紙を空白のままにして、そこにただ一語「不明」と書くのだ。",
      "scene": {
        "bg": "beach",
        "items": [
