    {
      "text": "One winter the young king summoned her. He was planning an expedition to the south, and he wanted a magnificent chart to display before his court. \"Draw me the southern ocean,\" he commanded, \"and leave nothing empty. Blankness resembles weakness.\"",
      "ja": "ある冬、若い王がオルサを呼びだした。王は南への遠征を計画していて、宮廷で見せるりっぱな海図をほしがった。「南の大洋をえがけ。空白は一つも残すな。空白は弱さに見える」と王は命じた。",
      "scene": {
        "bg": "snow",
        "items": [
          {
            "e": "🤴",
            "x": 65,
            "y": 68,
