    {
      "text": "Past the cape, the royal ships steered confidently into the channel that the rival had drawn. There was no channel. There were reefs, and three vessels were wrecked on them in a single night, though most of the sailors reached the shore.",
      "ja": "岬の先で、王の船団は、ライバルがえがいた水路へ自信たっぷりに進んだ。水路などなかった。あったのは岩礁で、一晩で3せきが難破した。ただ、船乗りのほとんどは岸にたどり着いた。",
